          "why": "Combined the variable terms correctly but dropped the constant $3$."
        }
      ],
      "solution_text": "$6y + y^2 - 2y^2 - 4y + 3$\n$= (y^2 - 2y^2) + (6y - 4y) + 3$\n$= -y^2 + 2y + 3$"
